    "Con Real-Debrid se ven y se descargan las películas y series. Agrega tu cuenta en Ajustes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-Debrid is what plays and downloads movies and shows. Add your account in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con Siri": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Siri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con Wi‑Fi": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Wi‑Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar fuentes de más de %lld GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular we ask before using sources over %lld GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar fuentes de más de 5 GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular data we warn you before using sources over 5 GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con datos móviles te avisamos antes de usar versiones de más de %lld GB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On cellular we'll ask before using versions over %lld GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el audio en ese idioma, solo esta vez.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the audio in that language, just this once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el día que las viste y tus estrellas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the day you watched them and your stars"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el enlace": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone with the link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con ella Orbital puede pedir videos a tu cuenta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With it, Orbital can request videos from your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con este arranca si lo hay": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts with this one if it's there"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con esto no verías nada": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this you wouldn't see anything"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con esto, %@ tiene %@ al instante y %@ para pedir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, %@ has %@ instant and %@ to request."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con esto, %@ tiene %@ versiones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, %@ has %@ versions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con esto, %@ tiene 1 versión.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this, %@ has 1 version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con géneros elegidos, el ánimo no cuenta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With genres picked, the mood doesn't count."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app abierta baja a toda velocidad; con la app cerrada iOS la frena mucho. Para bajar rápido, deja Orbital abierta: al salir, sigue sola, más lento.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app open it downloads at full speed; with the app closed iOS slows it down a lot. To download fast, keep Orbital open: when you leave, it keeps going on its own, slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app abierta lo sabes al momento. Con la app cerrada, iOS decide cuándo revisar: el aviso puede tardar un rato.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app open you know right away. With the app closed, iOS decides when to check: the notification may take a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la app cerrada, el aviso de que ya está puede tardar: iOS decide cuándo revisar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the app closed, the ready notification may take a while: iOS decides when to check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con la misma fecha": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the same date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con premios cuentan el formato, la época y lo que ya viste.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With awards, only format, era and what you've watched apply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con subtítulos para este video": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With subtitles for this video"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con subtítulos, en la misma frase.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With subtitles, in the same sentence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas, y las claves de Para ti salen de ella. Trakt se conecta aparte en cada uno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays what you're watching here on the console, right where you were, and your For You keys come from it. Trakt is connected separately on each one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas. Trakt se conecta aparte en cada uno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays on the console what you're watching here, where you left off. Trakt is connected separately on each."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu TV": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con tu historial, «Porque viste» y Para ti aciertan más.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your history, “Because you watched” and For you get it right more often."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con un código": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With a code"
          }
