            "value": "For the few"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para que los videos arranquen al instante, Orbital usa un servicio de pago que guarda películas y series: tu nube. Sirve cualquiera de estos tres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To make videos start instantly, Orbital uses a paid service that keeps movies and shows: your cloud. Any of these three works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para recordar a los que se fueron": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To remember those who are gone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para sordos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the hard of hearing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ti": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ti de tu Orbital": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For You, from your Orbital"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ver aquí mismo, al instante.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To watch right here, instantly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ver aquí necesitas una nube: un servicio de pago que guarda películas y series. Sirve Real-Debrid, TorBox o AllDebrid.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To watch here you need a cloud: a paid service that stores movies and shows. Real-Debrid, TorBox or AllDebrid all work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ver aquí, conecta un servicio de nube": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To watch here, connect a cloud service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para ver en familia": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
