    "Si Alexa dice que no puede, empieza con «pídele a mi consola que…»: sin eso, Alexa intenta hacerlo ella sola.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Alexa says she can't, start with “pídele a mi consola que…” (ask my console to…): without it, Alexa tries to do it herself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si Real-Debrid aún no lo tiene, se lo pide 3 min antes del final del que ves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Real-Debrid doesn't have it yet, it's requested 3 min before the end of the one you're watching."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si Real-Debrid no la reconoce, tu TV se queda con la que tenía.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
