    "Si dos la usan a la vez, Real-Debrid la corta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If two people use it at once, Real-Debrid cuts it off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si dos la usan a la vez, Real-Debrid la corta. Cada quien con la suya.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
