            "value": "If it doesn't hear you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si puso otra que se llama igual («pon Dune» y no era esa), pone la siguiente. En la TV en vivo, el siguiente canal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If it played another one with the same name (“play Dune” and it wasn't that one), it plays the next. On live TV, the next channel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si quieres ir rápido: desliza a la derecha para guardarla, a la izquierda para pasar y hacia arriba si es para hoy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you want to go fast: swipe right to save it, left to pass and up if it's for today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
