    "Si te cambias, lo que pediste en la otra sigue allá: lo ves si vuelves a ella.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you switch, what you requested in the other one stays there: you'll see it if you go back."
