        }
      }
    },
    "Si te gusta esta": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you like this one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si todavía no lo tiene, se lo pides y lo baja allá, no en este iPhone. Suele tardar de minutos a horas; si poca gente lo comparte, hasta días. A veces no lo deja bajar (derechos de autor) y te lo decimos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "device": {
              "ipad": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If it doesn't have it yet, you request it and it downloads it there, not on this device. It usually takes minutes to hours; if few people share it, up to days. Sometimes it won't allow it (copyright) and we'll tell you."
                }
              },
              "iphone": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If it doesn't have it yet, you request it and it downloads it there, not on this iPhone. It usually takes minutes to hours; if few people share it, up to days. Sometimes it won't allow it (copyright) and we'll tell you."
                }
              },
              "mac": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If it doesn't have it yet, you request it and it downloads it there, not on this Mac. It usually takes minutes to hours; if few people share it, up to days. Sometimes it won't allow it (copyright) and we'll tell you."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "If it doesn't have it yet, you request it and it downloads it there, not on this iPhone. It usually takes minutes to hours; if few people share it, up to days. Sometimes it won't allow it (copyright) and we'll tell you."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
